#. type: Title #
#: docs/features/companion.md:1 docs/features/companion.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Desktop Companion"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "> **Dynamic SAP satellite**: a standalone desktop GUI app, not managed via `config.yaml`.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:10
msgid ""
"The desktop companion is a SAP **Type B** app (embedded sidecar holds the "
"Hub WebSocket, `relay: false`): the **content pack** (React + VRM + Node "
"sidecar) is embedded by the **desktop shell** (`src/app/shell/desktop`), "
"registers with the Hub via SAP, and exposes local tools to the Agent."
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: docs/features/companion.md:13
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"FreeAnima Desktop (src/app/shell/desktop)\n"
"├── Electron Main — tray / multi-window + embedded companion sidecar\n"
"│   ├── companion overlay — transparent always-on-top, VRM / speech bubble\n"
"│   ├── companion settings — settings window\n"
"│   ├── chat — Chat SPA (SAP direct, no sidecar)\n"
"│   └── console — Console WebView (Hub REST)\n"
"└── Renderer — preload satelliteShell; companion API via localhost sidecar\n"
"         ↕ SAP WS\n"
"    anima service Hub\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:26
msgid ""
"The content pack lives in [`src/satellites/companion/`](../../src/satellites/"
"companion/) (`spa/` + `server/` + `shared/`). Export conventions: [`frontend-"
"exports.md`](../sap/frontend-exports.md)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:28
msgid "Compared with Chat / pair programming:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:35
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"|             | Chat / pair programming              | Companion                                            |\n"
"| ----------- | ------------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| UI          | Browser Web UI                       | Native transparent companion window + settings       |\n"
"| Deployment  | Managed (can co-locate with service) | Dynamic (user starts manually)                       |\n"
"| SAP         | Type A or Type B + relay             | Type B + tools, no relay                             |\n"
"| Client & UI | Can be separated                     | Companion render and settings share one Electron app |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <messages><msg>
#: docs/features/companion.md:36 messages/po4a/en.xml:582
#, no-wrap
msgid "Features"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/companion.md:46
msgid ""
"VRM avatar rendering (Three.js + `@pixiv/three-vrm`); VRM 1.0 and 0.x auto "
"orientation correction"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/companion.md:46
msgid ""
"**Motion slots**: five slots — `idle`, `rest`, `walk`, `climb`, `in_place`; "
"each slot binds 0..n VRMA clips; play by id or random; empty slot = no "
"animation"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/companion.md:46
msgid ""
"**Speech bubble**: one-way text queue; user click advances; no auto-dismiss; "
"pushed by Hub Agent via `companion.bubble` tool"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/companion.md:46
msgid ""
"Transparent always-on-top companion window (160×260); avatar area clickable, "
"empty area click-through"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/companion.md:46
msgid ""
"**Local interaction**: drag to move window; click body to play random motion "
"from `in_place` slot"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/companion.md:46
msgid ""
"**Patrol** (Settings → Behavior tab): idle patrol, double-click patrol, "
"corner pause, patrol speed, return-to-start on launch, etc."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/companion.md:46
msgid ""
"System tray: show/hide companion, **Settings…** (open settings window), quit"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/companion.md:46
msgid ""
"Settings tabs: **General** / **Behavior** / **Models** / **Motion slots** / "
"**Motion library**"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/companion.md:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "Agent tools (sidecar registration)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:53
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Tool        | Parameters                           | Description                            |\n"
"| ----------- | ------------------------------------ | -------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `bubble`    | `text: string`                       | Enqueue text in speech bubble          |\n"
"| `play_slot` | `slot: string`; `motion_id?: string` | Play motion slot; `motion_id` optional |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:55
msgid ""
"Periodic content (e.g. scheduled jokes) is configured on **anima service / "
"scheduled tasks**; the Agent calls `bubble`. Companion has no built-in timer."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/companion.md:56
#, no-wrap
msgid "Models and motions"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:59
msgid ""
"The repo **does not bundle** `.vrm` / `.vrma` files. Config persists in "
"`~/.anima/companion/config.json` (`models`, `motion_library`, "
"`motion_slots`, `behavior`)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/features/companion.md:60
#, no-wrap
msgid "VRM models"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:63
msgid ""
"Settings → **Models** tab: list, import, delete, rename, switch current "
"model. Files saved to `~/.anima/companion/models/`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:65
msgid ""
"During development, files in `src/satellites/companion/public/models/` serve "
"as fallback."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/features/companion.md:66
#, no-wrap
msgid "VRMA library and slots"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:69
msgid ""
"Settings → **Motion library** tab: import VRMA ZIP or single files; **Motion "
"slots** tab: assign motions per slot. Preview supports mouse drag to rotate "
"view."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:71
msgid ""
"Motion files: `~/.anima/companion/motions/`. Unbound slots play no "
"animation; patrol still moves the window; walk/climb VRMA play only when "
"bound."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/companion.md:72
#, no-wrap
msgid "Development and run"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/features/companion.md:74
#, no-wrap
msgid "Browser dev (no Electron)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:77
msgid "In `src/satellites/companion`:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/features/companion.md:78
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"bun run dev\n"
"# or bun src/satellites/companion/dev.ts\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/companion.md:85
msgid "Companion: http://127.0.0.1:4176"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/companion.md:85
msgid "Settings (browser dev): http://127.0.0.1:4176/?view=settings"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:87
msgid ""
"In the Electron desktop shell, open settings via tray → **Settings…**; the "
"overlay has no settings button."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/features/companion.md:88
#, no-wrap
msgid "Electron desktop shell (companion + Chat + Console)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/features/companion.md:90
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# 从仓库根目录\n"
"bun run dev:windows\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:96
msgid "Packaging (Linux cross-build for Windows):"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/features/companion.md:97
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Daily: portable win-unpacked (~20s; copy exe to Windows)\n"
"bun run dev:windows\n"
"\n"
"# Installer / install-flow test (NSIS, ~2min+)\n"
"bun run package:windows\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:106
msgid ""
"Or from repository root: `bun run dev:windows` / `bun run package:windows`. "
"Fast path keeps `vendor/` and `release/` for incremental builds; full clean: "
"`DESKTOP_SHELL_CLEAN=1`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:108
msgid "Environment variables:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:114
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Variable                 | Default                 | Description                                     |\n"
"| ------------------------ | ----------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `FREEANIMA_URL`          | `http://127.0.0.1:2658` | Hub fallback when no desktop `settings.json`    |\n"
"| `SATELLITE_PORT`         | `4176`                  | Local HTTP port                                 |\n"
"| `COMPANION_VRMA_ZIP_URL` | (empty)                 | Optional direct zip mirror; downloaded on start |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:116
msgid ""
"Hub URL and remote token are managed by the desktop shell in **`~/.anima-"
"desktop/settings.json`** (`hub` section; tray → **Hub settings…**). "
"Companion Settings → General tab shows Hub URL read-only."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:118
msgid ""
"Hub assigns a **3-character** `instance_id` on first `connect`, stored in "
"`~/.anima/companion/instance.json` (not under `src/satellites/`)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/companion.md:119 docs/features/mobile-app.md:52
#: docs/guide/database.md:88 docs/guide/remote-access.md:177
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:129
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Symptom                  | Action                                                                                                 |\n"
"| ------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| Double-click, no window  | Check system tray; tray → **Settings…** → import `.vrm`                                                |\n"
"| Click, no motion         | Settings → **Motion library** import VRMA; **Motion slots** bind slot                                  |\n"
"| Cannot reach Hub         | Confirm `anima service` and Hub settings token (`fa_at_...`); tray **Hub settings** URL and token      |\n"
"| Import has no effect     | Hot reload after import; confirm slot has motion checked                                               |\n"
"| Background service fails | See `~/.anima/desktop-shell/shell.log`; confirm ports 4176–4185 free                           |\n"
"| FBX import unavailable   | Run `bun run setup:fbx` (caches to `~/.anima/tools/fbx2gltf/`)                                 |\n"
msgstr ""

